{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>My Sexy Neighbor 2</strong>, you're the member of a spicy online forum where your fans throw cash at you to do whatever twisted stuff they can dream up \u2014 from stealing a neighbor's favorite panties to breaking into homes and recording the aftermath.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The bigger the dare, the fatter the donation. And the higher the heat, the crazier the challenges get. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684710/extras/75c865111cea0652487925b0404caa58.poster.avif?t=1765327448\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684710/extras/75c865111cea0652487925b0404caa58.webm?t=1765327448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684710/extras/75c865111cea0652487925b0404caa58.mp4?t=1765327448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roam freely through a quiet-looking suburban neighborhood, upgrade your skills, buy gadgets, and turn your humble online blog into the ultimate NSFW empire. Just don\u2019t get caught\u2026 or it\u2019s game over. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684710/extras/c061c6918afdf7e1716cd981d795800f.poster.avif?t=1765327448\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684710/extras/c061c6918afdf7e1716cd981d795800f.webm?t=1765327448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684710/extras/c061c6918afdf7e1716cd981d795800f.mp4?t=1765327448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udde9KEY FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf06 <strong>Fully explorable, realistic neighborhood</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sneak through yards, figure out your neighbors\u2019 routines, and get creative with your routes. Every door hides an opportunity. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcf9 <strong>Real-time blogging &amp; donation system</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your fans want content \u2014 and they\u2019re paying for it. Take on requests, stream your missions, and build up your rep as the king of chaos. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd75\ufe0f\u200d\u2642\ufe0f <strong>Stealth meets kink</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use gadgets, hide in shadows, and play smart \u2014 or go bold and risky. Your reward? Raw, uncensored adult scenes, straight from the action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \ud83d\udcb8 <strong>Level up through hustle</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your earnings on skills, new tools, or just go all out on prepping for the next big challenge. More money = more madness. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd1e <strong>Unfiltered 18+ content</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing is blurred, nothing is held back. This is full-on voyeur, adult-sim territory \u2014 for players who dare to push boundaries.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"This is just the beginning","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3684710/a131a385bdf961ad65605cb4b60fc084386966f4.jpg"},{"name":"It's getting hot","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3684710/189e0f77cdf0ac32da3b7df8f0dca53637cb93ca.jpg"},{"name":"Dirty blog","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3684710/4bc01f7726edf4e01dc2ab266dd94141d2e12747.jpg"},{"na